  "957701803": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "Adrian, I had no choice. We can't afford it right now.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1314910441": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Adrian",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "No choice? You promised! This trip was the one thing I was looking forward to all year!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1429916141": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I know, but things have changed. We have to prioritize necessities.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1858333667": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Adrian",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Prioritize? You knew how much this meant to me! You've been failing at everything lately, and now you're ruining my plans too!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1005048383": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Watch your tone, Adrian! Do you think I wanted this? ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "234949959": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "I'm trying my best to fix things, but it's not easy. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "786479556": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Adrian",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "So, what? I'm just supposed to sit here and watch everything fall apart?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1024359149": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Josef",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "No, you're supposed to understand that sometimes life doesn't go as planned. We have to stick together and get through this.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-634485382": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Adrian",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You don’t get it. You’re ruining everything for me!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
